This product contains code from ArtificialAnalysis/Stirrup
(https://github.com/ArtificialAnalysis/Stirrup), licensed under the MIT License.

Specifically, src/agent_tracer/models/client.py adapts the response-parsing
logic of stirrup.clients.chat_completions_client (stirrup 0.2.0) so the field
holding a model's reasoning text can be named per model rather than fixed. That
file remains subject to the MIT License reproduced below; the rest of this
product is licensed under Apache License 2.0.

Stirrup is also a runtime dependency, installed from PyPI rather than
redistributed here.

